{
  "id": "03-kingdom-citizens",
  "title": "Citizens of the Kingdom",
  "tenet": "Live by its righteousness",
  "durationMs": 41448,
  "audioAsset": "kingdom/03-kingdom-citizens.mp3",
  "transcriptAsset": "assets/kingdom/03-kingdom-citizens.json",
  "text": "Imagine entering a city where every neighbor protects the weak and speaks the truth. You would know its way of life by how people treat one another. Jesus speaks of a Kingdom with a deeper righteousness. Its citizens learn mercy, honesty, justice, humility, and faithfulness. These are not rules for earning God's love. They are the shape of a life growing under his reign. We cannot claim the life of the Kingdom while refusing its love for our neighbor. Ask where your daily conduct needs to agree with your prayer. Make one honest repair. Choose one fair action. Let the way you speak, spend, work, and serve show whose Kingdom you seek.",
